  "source_sha256": "0d950f10067fc3f2752a0355c8b4782ab052e690adf6be45dd8885279a8ae457",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ca7eed65a302bb0f81b4c13e80e8fad678c7297a4ed723d277b647aeeb248162",
      "text": "Princess Iron Fan’s\nPattern Parade",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "20a7c543c60af9f189602fddc602244333f54b80178ff2f896e8a812030d7844",
      "text": "Princess Iron Fan is planning\na little parade.\nA long rope hangs\nacross her courtyard.\n“Let’s hang flags on it!”\nshe says.\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d11d318ea0c02ca087468bcb1e4be7af4668989931d84439eb82d9be9534bbf1",
      "text": "Nezha brings a basket\nof flags.\nSome are red. Some are gold.\nWukong hangs them on\nthe rope.\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c22fdfa7def48329396dd7206b22945a9918b100ae25acfd5a9fc84b129cc1f3",
      "text": "Red, red, gold.\nRed, red, gold.\n“That is a pattern,” says\nthe princess.\n“The same group repeats.”\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7f0e1e44cde7ad201fac4494a3dd0b3a77822698d69173bba362621fe9381044",
      "text": "A little breeze blows.\nThe flags wiggle and wave.\n“The parade starts soon!”\nsays Wukong.\n“I must hurry!”\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2e415f5c4e99c5d2246f6d3eff5b202a0ac1d91481f55c1302b1352a2c9eda2f",
      "text": "Wukong grabs the flags fast.\nRed… gold… gold!\n“All done!” he shouts.\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1a86b20b6dce80e550f924d461c203f3b7c489ff7977a92914e385a848f42a32",
      "text": "Nezha peeks into the basket.\n“One red flag is left,”\nhe says.\n“Should it be up there?”\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0ba08e16e8f03986e0715f0214bc1385b105962b4981e1daa4d39eb0500712a9",
      "text": "“Let’s check with a clap,”\nsays the princess.\n“Red is a clap. Gold is\na stomp.”\nClap, clap, stomp!\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5b5242e0ba8bddd2ad4f56ffcc3df94a861fc8bae0cd730947e4091b386fb113",
      "text": "They clap along the rope.\nClap, clap, stomp.\nClap, clap, stomp.\nClap… stomp, stomp?\n“That sounds funny!”\nsays Wukong.\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "777bc40e82fa6c17990a1a0b564f65c58958f75ec5de4dfb8a0881774187a2d9",
      "text": "They check one group at\na time.\nRed, red, gold. The same.\nRed, red, gold. The same.\nRed, gold, gold. Different!\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "891173839ecc233755cc48b9a50704533aee8d79302ce579baafd12a31d421e6",
      "text": "“The middle flag should be\nred,” says Nezha.\n“Gold comes next,\nbecause the group repeats.”\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "704ff1b29fc95d62e51c3b873a6e11b925ebcef7387740f03a5a1614737aa4ec",
      "text": "Wukong swaps the middle\ngold flag\nfor the red one.\nThe gold flag goes back\nin the basket.\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8be3cba1d5663d3a41ada584403559e51e9de2fc0df79b22178cb647ff206920",
      "text": "Clap, clap, stomp!\nClap, clap, stomp!\nClap, clap, stomp!\n“Now it repeats all the way!”\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "09d10e43a8cd0f6e28f0ab2b212c883e7f9affabee454278fad72c36f762c3c4",
      "text": "The parade begins!\nThe princess waves her fan.\nNezha claps the beat.\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2dff3c45bf3b573378c9e85c5439ad45871defaca1b4af12915681065fe4dedc",
      "text": "Wukong marches under\nthe flags.\nStep, step, swish!\nStep, step, swish!\nHis tail joins the pattern too.\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0c11a670be9533b57d8ac7fa45287f0c2bc02f056f0cbc971d5c05ed895a1d88",
      "text": "“What comes next?” asks\nthe princess.\nStep, step…\n“SWISH!” everyone shouts.\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
